# THIS_FILE_IS_MANAGED_BY_ANSIBLE__DO_NOT_EDIT_MANUALLY
# Bookmarked places - file-dialog "Places" sidebar - /etc/apparmor.d/abstractions/local_mixin_bookmarked_places
#
# OPT-IN, split-policy. Include ONLY in network-denied LOCAL KIO apps (gwenview,
# mscore3, ...) whose file dialog shows the "Places" sidebar. user-places.xbel
# holds low-value path metadata (bookmarked locations + mounted devices), not
# contents/secrets. KIO-specific - GTK apps use ~/.config/gtk-3.0/bookmarks - so
# it is separate from the cross-toolkit local_mixin_recent_file_list. Do NOT
# include in network-facing apps (they would leak the user's bookmarked paths).

owner @{HOME}/.local/share/user-places.xbel r,
